  "Apps that send system notifications, such as QQ. Allow notification access in Windows privacy settings.": "QQ 等发出系统通知的应用。需要在 Windows 隐私设置中允许访问通知。",
  "Turned off, Windows' own taskbar and notification banners come back; widgets and Stage Manager are not affected.": "关闭后用回 Windows 自己的任务栏和通知横幅；小组件和台前调度不受影响。",
  "The app in front stays in the middle; other apps' windows stand at an angle at the side, each with its shadow and app icon.": "前面的应用留在屏幕中间，其他应用的窗口斜立在屏幕一侧，各带阴影和应用图标。",
  "Cards show only the app and the title; the notification window is also excluded from screen capture and sharing.": "卡片只显示应用和标题；通知窗口同时不会出现在截图和屏幕共享里。",
  "Keep only the Atrium bar. Windows' taskbar returns when this is turned off or Atrium quits; system shortcuts such as the Windows key keep working.": "只留下 Atrium 栏。关闭开关或退出 Atrium 时恢复；Win 键等系统快捷键照常可用。",
  "Reads the chat list in WeChat's window; cards appear for new unread messages. Muted chats are ignored.": "只读微信窗口里的会话列表，有新的未读消息时显示卡片；免打扰的会话不提醒。",
  "Reads the text of Feishu popups and shows it as a card; clicking the card opens Feishu.": "只读飞书弹窗里的文字，同时显示为卡片；点击卡片打开飞书。",
  "After pinned apps, other running apps appear with a small dot below.": "固定的应用之后，显示正在运行的其他应用，下方带一个小圆点。",
  "At the right end of the bar, using the system's time and date format.": "在栏的右端，使用系统的时间与日期格式。",
  "On, the taskbars on other displays hide the tray, status ring, clock and notifications.": "开启后，其他屏幕的任务栏隐藏系统托盘、状态圆环、时钟日期和通知按钮。",
  "Turns on Windows' Do Not Disturb; notifications still appear as Atrium cards. Restored when turned off or Atrium quits.": "打开 Windows 的“请勿打扰”；通知照常显示为 Atrium 卡片。关闭开关或退出时恢复。",
  "Drag to move, drag the lower corner to resize, right-click to remove.": "拖动可移动，拖下角可改变大小，右键可移除。",
  "The glass bar grows with its content, like a capsule around its items; off, it is fixed at Maximum width.": "玻璃栏随内容伸缩，像一枚贴合物品的胶囊；关闭后固定为“最大宽度”。",
  "Start Atrium when you sign in to Windows.": "登录 Windows 时启动 Atrium。",
  "The background rises under the pointer; the amount follows the taskbar's hover magnification.": "背景随鼠标位置向上拱起，幅度跟随任务栏的悬停放大设置。",
